{
  "entry": "greeting",
  "nodes": {
    "greeting": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh, hello again."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Could we talk about the other night?",
          "next": "prelude_concern",
          "when": {
            "active_events": [
              "prelude_boundary"
            ]
          },
          "priority": 30,
          "grey_when_picked": false
        },
        {
          "text": "Is something bothering you?",
          "next": "morale_check",
          "when": {
            "max_affection": 45
          },
          "priority": 15,
          "grey_when_picked": false
        },
        {
          "text": "How are you liking it here?",
          "next": "curiosity"
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you gone exploring at all?",
          "next": "exploring"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can you remind me about something?",
          "next": "reminder_intro",
          "required_flags": [
            "gift_attempted"
          ],
          "forbidden_flags": [
            "spyglass_complete"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You said we could explore together someday...",
          "next": "explore_followup",
          "when": {
            "active_events": [
              "explore_together"
            ]
          },
          "priority": 4,
          "grey_when_picked": false
        },
        {
          "text": "How's the spyglass working out?",
          "next": "spyglass_chat",
          "required_flags": [
            "spyglass_complete"
          ],
          "grey_when_picked": false
        },
        {
          "text": "See you later!",
          "next": "goodbye",
          "spends_action": false,
          "grey_when_picked": false
        }
      ],
      "line_variants": [
        {
          "when": {
            "active_events": [
              "prelude_boundary"
            ]
          },
          "lines": [
            "Oh... Penni.",
            "I wasn't sure if you'd want to talk after the other night."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "required_flags": [
              "refuses_diving"
            ]
          },
          "lines": [
            "Oh... Penni.",
            "I don't want to go diving right now. Can we talk instead?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "max_affection": 25
          },
          "lines": [
            "Oh. Hello again.",
            "I've been feeling a little left out lately."
          ]
        },
        {
          "when": {
            "max_affection": 45
          },
          "lines": [
            "Oh... hi.",
            "I was starting to wonder when we'd talk again."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "curiosity": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh! There's so many new things to look at!",
        "Back home, there were these fish that would swim by with the prettiest colors.",
        "I didn't think there'd be anything like that up here, but I keep seeing these things flying overhead.",
        "I can't really make out what they are, but it's fascinating!",
        "Oh- sorry. I'm talking too much..."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hehe, no! It's cute when you get excited.",
          "next": "curiosity_cute"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm glad you're enjoying your time here!",
          "next": "curiosity_glad"
        }
      ]
    },
    "curiosity_cute": {
      "lines": [
        "O-oh. You think so?",
        "...Thank you."
      ],
      "next": "topics"
    },
    "curiosity_glad": {
      "lines": [
        "Me too!",
        "I'm glad you convinced me to stay."
      ],
      "next": "topics"
    },
    "exploring": {
      "lines": [
        "Well, I would, but—",
        "I just keep getting this weird feeling in my legs?",
        "I'm not used to moving around on my own like this.",
        "And who knows what could happen if I did?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "It's okay! You're just a little scared. You can take your time.",
          "next": "exploring_comfort"
        },
        {
          "text": "Well, maybe one day we can go exploring together!",
          "next": "exploring_together"
        }
      ]
    },
    "exploring_comfort": {
      "lines": [
        "I guess you're right.",
        "...Thank you."
      ],
      "next": "topics"
    },
    "exploring_together": {
      "lines": [
        "T-together?",
        "Oh... I'd like that."
      ],
      "next": "topics",
      "effects": {
        "start_relationship_events": [
          "explore_together"
        ]
      }
    },
    "reminder_intro": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh, sure. What was it?"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "You mentioned something across the lake?",
          "next": "lake_reminder",
          "required_flags": [
            "heard_lake_hint"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What was that thing you saw in the distance?",
          "next": "distant_reminder",
          "required_flags": [
            "heard_distant_hint"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never mind!",
          "next": "reminder_cancel",
          "grey_when_picked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "lake_reminder": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh, I was wondering what the other shore looks like.",
        "It's a bit far to go see for myself."
      ],
      "next": "topics"
    },
    "distant_reminder": {
      "lines": [
        "Not yet. Whatever it was, I still can't make it out from here."
      ],
      "next": "topics"
    },
    "reminder_cancel": {
      "lines": [
        "Oh, okay!"
      ],
      "next": "topics"
    },
    "goodbye": {
